===============================================================================

The Software does not vendor third-party source code. It depends on external
packages installed separately via `requirements.txt`, each governed by its own
license — including PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), Hugging Face Tokenizers
(Apache-2.0), SentencePiece (Apache-2.0), FastAPI (MIT), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause)
and Pydantic (MIT). This License does not restrict, enlarge or override any of
them, and grants no rights in them.

The recursive-reasoning component in `trm/` is an independent implementation
written by the Licensor. It is informed by published academic work
(Jolicoeur-Martineau, "Less is More: Recursive Reasoning with Tiny Networks",
2025; Wang et al., Hierarchical Reasoning Model). Those papers are cited as
prior art; no code from them is incorporated.

